WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:21.745
The grandest ship in the kingdom was chosen to take the Prince to the neighboring kingdom.

2
00:00:22.766 --> 00:00:26.369
Decked out with ribbons and banners, it was ready for the voyage.

3
00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:30.492
The Prince explained the trip to the Little Mermaid.

4
00:00:31.604 --> 00:00:33.906
"It is my parents' wish that I meet the princess.

5
00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:37.209
But you and I know that I will never marry her.

6
00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:41.653
After all she surely cannot be the girl who saved my life."

7
00:00:43.694 --> 00:00:48.739
Once again the mermaid thought, "How sad it is that he doesn't know I saved him."

8
00:00:48.759 --> 00:00:55.384
"But if I had to choose a bride other than the Maiden," the Prince continued, "it would be

9
00:00:55.424 --> 00:00:59.488
you." Then he kissed the mermaid in his brotherly way.

10
00:01:01.216 --> 00:01:03.197
The Little Mermaid smiled up at him.

11
00:01:03.217 --> 00:01:09.358
"Maybe my dream of marrying the Prince will come true after all," she thought.

12
00:01:10.719 --> 00:01:12.979
And for the moment, she was happy.

13
00:01:12.999 --> 00:01:17.901
"You will come with me on this voyage, my little companion," he said.

14
00:01:17.921 --> 00:01:21.442
"I just hope you won't be too frightened by the sea."

15
00:01:22.602 --> 00:01:24.783
The Little Mermaid smiled to herself.

16
00:01:24.803 --> 00:01:29.564
"My Prince doesn't know it, but I will feel right at home at sea."

17
00:01:31.276 --> 00:01:37.879
The Little Mermaid, along with the royal travelers, boarded the grand ship for their overnight journey.

18
00:01:39.059 --> 00:01:45.222
That night, while everyone slept, the Little Mermaid sat on deck, gazing into the sea.

19
00:01:46.582 --> 00:01:50.104
She thought she saw her whole family floating just beneath the waves.

20
00:01:51.204 --> 00:01:53.905
They seemed to be calling to her to come home.

21
00:01:53.925 --> 00:01:57.947
"I wish you well," she thought.

22
00:01:57.967 --> 00:02:00.828
"But I must follow my heart."

23
00:02:01.972 --> 00:02:06.116
The next morning the ship came into the harbor of the nearby kingdom.

24
00:02:07.216 --> 00:02:10.459
Its king and queen awaited the Prince and his companions.

25
00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:13.782
Trumpets sounded from tall towers.

26
00:02:16.384 --> 00:02:20.047
The citizens of the land gathered by the docks to greet their guests.

27
00:02:20.067 --> 00:02:22.969
"He's handsome!"

28
00:02:23.389 --> 00:02:26.232
a girl shouted when she saw the Prince step off the ship.

29
00:02:27.693 --> 00:02:32.709
"What a wonderful match for our princess," said an old woman.

30
00:02:32.729 --> 00:02:38.031
"It's a pity that she isn't here to welcome him."

31
00:02:38.051 --> 00:02:42.573
"She'll be here tomorrow," replied the girl.

32
00:02:42.593 --> 00:02:45.655
"A little wait won't hurt him."

33
00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:52.137
The next day the hours passed quickly as everyone celebrated in the streets.

34
00:02:53.398 --> 00:03:00.173
At last a royal guard rode through the city announcing, "Come to the palace hall!

35
00:03:00.533 --> 00:03:02.334
The princess has arrived!"

36
00:03:04.274 --> 00:03:05.915
Everyone rushed to the hall.

37
00:03:07.076 --> 00:03:09.056
They all wanted to get a good look at her.

38
00:03:10.177 --> 00:03:14.399
Pushing through the crowd, the Little Mermaid was very curious too.

39
00:03:15.579 --> 00:03:21.122
Finally the princess appeared—tall, delicate, and dressed in white satin.

40
00:03:21.142 --> 00:03:26.504
"She is truly beautiful," thought the Little Mermaid.

41
00:03:27.644 --> 00:03:29.265
"And she looks a bit familiar."

42
00:03:30.326 --> 00:03:34.128
The princess's perfect skin was pale and clear.

43
00:03:35.309 --> 00:03:37.670
Her black hair was long and shiny.

44
00:03:38.891 --> 00:03:44.474
Under her long, dark lashes were the deepest green eyes that the Little Mermaid had ever seen.

45
00:03:45.955 --> 00:03:51.378
The Little Mermaid thought, "I'm glad my Prince is not interested in marrying her."

46
00:03:52.438 --> 00:03:54.980
But then the Prince stepped up to greet the princess.

47
00:03:56.128 --> 00:03:58.571
When he saw her up close, he gasped.

48
00:03:58.591 --> 00:04:00.593
"It is you!

49
00:04:01.193 --> 00:04:02.655
You are the one who saved my life.

50
00:04:03.936 --> 00:04:06.279
I remember waking up on the shore to see your face."

51
00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:11.304
He took the Maiden's small hand and kissed it gallantly.

52
00:04:11.324 --> 00:04:14.928
"I am very lucky to meet you again, my princess.

53
00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.812
And I would be most honored to marry you."
